{"parentUuid":"7a05fe75-b892-48b5-90ce-30a1263f45f2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a8a448561dbacf07c","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Vtie1gcwbHfBx7jB3LhHeg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FaUpSbRmVEgrhw1wun2JZb","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Gemini 2.5 Flash Pro API pricing 2026 per million tokens"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5543,"cache_read_input_tokens":27129,"output_tokens":599,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5543},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":599,"cache_read_input_tokens":27129,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5543,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5543,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cassd5UR3TcJh7eqWELFf","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"3502c14f-00fb-4218-8a29-8dde068967d0","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:36:48.815Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"5fc220fc-2cd6-4672-8cfd-6f1402a22660","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a8a448561dbacf07c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BsUPHUJq5bcc3F63LkU2nY","type":"tool_result","content":"# OpenEvolve Project Analysis\n\n## (1) Latest Release\n- **Version**: v0.2.27\n- **Date**: March 18, 2026\n\n## (2) Supported LLM Backends\nThe project supports \"any OpenAI-compatible API\" including:\n- OpenAI (direct)\n- Google Gemini (2.5-Pro, 2.5-Flash)\n- Local models (Ollama, vLLM, LM Studio)\n- OptiLLM (with test-time compute routing)\n\n**Note**: No explicit mention of Claude, DeepSeek, or MIP/LBBD solvers.\n\n## (3) Production-Ready Status\nDescribed as \"research grade\" with \"full reproducibility\" and \"scientific rigor built-in.\" The project emphasizes deterministic, seeded evolution (default seed=42) and includes comprehensive evaluation pipelines.\n\n## (4) Success Cases\nDocumented achievements focus on:\n- GPU kernel optimization (2.8x speedup on Apple M1)\n- Circle packing (state-of-the-art n=26)\n- Adaptive sorting algorithms\n- Signal processing filter design\n\n**Critical gap**: No discrete optimization (SAT, CP, MIP, LBBD) use cases mentioned.\n\n## (5) Community Metrics\n- **Stars**: 6.2k\n- **Forks**: 998\n- **Contributors**: Approximately 57 watchers (exact contributor count not clearly stated)\n\n## (6) Installation Complexity\nMinimal barrier to entry: \"pip install openevolve\" works immediately. Configuration is optional; defaults provided. Docker option available for containerized deployment."}]},"uuid":"1e3ef58b-7ee8-488c-9b06-508a4fbb27d4","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:36:53.729Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5fc220fc-2cd6-4672-8cfd-6f1402a22660","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"3502c14f-00fb-4218-8a29-8dde068967d0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a8a448561dbacf07c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FaUpSbRmVEgrhw1wun2JZb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini 2.5 Flash Pro API pricing 2026 per million tokens\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Gemini 2.5 Flash API Pricing 2026 - Costs, Performance & Providers\",\"url\":\"https://pricepertoken.com/pricing-page/model/google-gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Developer API pricing | Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Pricing 2026: Complete Cost Guide for All Models | MetaCTO\",\"url\":\"https://www.metacto.com/blogs/the-true-cost-of-google-gemini-a-guide-to-api-pricing-and-integration\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 2.5 Pro API Pricing 2026 - Costs, Performance & Providers\",\"url\":\"https://pricepertoken.com/pricing-page/model/google-gemini-2.5-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 2.5 Flash - API Pricing & Benchmarks | OpenRouter\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/google/gemini-2.5-flash\"},{\"title\":\"Agent Platform Pricing | Google Cloud\",\"url\":\"https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Pricing Calculator & Cost Guide (May 2026)\",\"url\":\"https://costgoat.com/pricing/gemini-api\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Pricing 2026: 2.5 Pro at $1.25/M (Free Tier Available) | TLDL | TLDL\",\"url\":\"https://www.tldl.io/resources/google-gemini-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini API Pricing 2026: Complete Per-1M-Token Cost Guide with Calculator - All 7 Models Compared | Free Tier Details | Cost Optimization Tips | AI Free API\",\"url\":\"https://www.aifreeapi.com/en/posts/gemini-api-pricing-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Google Gemini API Pricing 2026: Plans & Hidden Costs\",\"url\":\"https://costbench.com/software/llm-api-providers/google-gemini-api/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's the current Gemini API pricing information for 2026:\n\n## Gemini 2.5 Flash Pro API Pricing (2026)\n\nNote: Google offers **Gemini 2.5 Flash** and **Gemini 2.5 Pro** as separate models, not a \"Flash Pro\" variant.\n\n### Gemini 2.5 Flash Pricing:\nPricing starts at $0.300 per million input tokens and $2.50 per million output tokens.\n\n### Gemini 2.5 Pro Pricing:\nPricing starts at $1.00 per million input tokens and $10.00 per million output tokens. However, Gemini 2.5 Pro charges $1.25 per million input tokens for contexts under 200K, but this jumps to $2.50 per million for longer contexts.\n\n### Additional Details:\n- The model supports a context window of up to 1.0M tokens.\n- API access is available through Google.\n- A free tier is available with up to 1,500 requests/day on Flash models via Google AI Studio.\n\nIf you're looking for a specific \"Flash Pro\" model or need Vertex AI pricing information, those may differ from the standard Gemini API pricing shown above.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"38d50e81-030b-4ddc-84d7-7b236a43737c","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:36:53.884Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3502c14f-00fb-4218-8a29-8dde068967d0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a08628ab-96c5-4cf3-8304-cc25a7815d40","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a8a448561dbacf07c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NEj2aFxbqbf73WiUYey2t8","type":"tool_result","content":"# OpenEvolve: Recent Release Summary\n\n## Latest 5 Releases\n\n| Version | Date | Key Changes |\n|---------|------|-------------|\n| **v0.2.27** | Mar 18 | \"warn when custom template directory doesn't exist\"; enhanced diff summaries; fixed island-based evolution distribution |\n| **v0.2.26** | Jan 28 | Manual mode UI improvements; ARC-AGI-2 example added; \"large codebase support through LLM changes description\"; TSP example; Anthropic model fixes |\n| **v0.2.25** | Dec 23 | Configuration simplification with `dacite`; pre-commit integration; template refactoring |\n| **v0.2.24** | Dec 18 | \"feat: ${VAR} for API key configuration\"; configurable diff patterns; island population fixes; Gemini default model option |\n| **v0.2.23** | Dec 11 | \"max_tasks_per_child configurable\" for CUDA memory leak mitigation; SLDBench benchmark added |\n\n## Notable Improvements\n\n**LLM Backends**: Added Gemini default option, Anthropic parameter handling fixes, regional OpenAI endpoint support\n\n**New Examples**: ARC-AGI-2 benchmark, SLDBench, TSP optimization using large-codebase approach\n\n**Production Readiness**: Memory management enhancements, configuration flexibility, improved error handling, event-based early stopping capability"}]},"uuid":"a535fb23-00d4-4686-bb1f-05b3ec222db9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:36:54.725Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a08628ab-96c5-4cf3-8304-cc25a7815d40","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"7a05fe75-b892-48b5-90ce-30a1263f45f2","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a8a448561dbacf07c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DHEgAh2EGj3uaK5VwdNcLP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Anthropic Claude API pricing 2026 May Opus Sonnet input output tokens\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Pricing - Claude API Docs\",\"url\":\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude API Pricing 2026: Latest Anthropic Costs for Opus, Sonnet, Haiku\",\"url\":\"https://evolink.ai/blog/claude-api-pricing-guide-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude API Pricing 2026: Haiku $0.25, Sonnet $3, Opus $15/1M\",\"url\":\"https://pecollective.com/tools/anthropic-api-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing 2026: The Real Cost Story Behind the “Unchanged” Price Tag\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/claude-opus-4.7-pricing-the-real-cost-story-behind-the-unchanged-price-tag\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic API Pricing in 2026: Complete Guide — Models, Caching, Batch & Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Claude API Pricing 2026: Opus 4.7, Sonnet 4.6, Haiku | AI Pricing Guru\",\"url\":\"https://www.aipricing.guru/anthropic-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude API Pricing 2026: Full Anthropic Cost Breakdown\",\"url\":\"https://www.metacto.com/blogs/anthropic-api-pricing-a-full-breakdown-of-costs-and-integration\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Claude API Pricing 2026 - Silicon Data — GPU Performance Data for Companies\",\"url\":\"https://www.silicondata.com/use-cases/anthropic-claude-api-pricing-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude API Pricing 2026: Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6, Haiku 4.5 Cost per 1M Tokens - DevTk.AI\",\"url\":\"https://devtk.ai/en/blog/claude-api-pricing-guide-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing In 2026: What It Actually Costs (And Whether It's Worth It)\",\"url\":\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/claude-opus-4-7-pricing/\"}]\n\nBased on the latest search results, here's the current Anthropic Claude API pricing as of May 2026:\n\n## Current Claude Model Pricing (May 2026)\n\nHaiku 4.5 starts at $1/$5 per million tokens, Sonnet 4.6 is $3/$15, and both Opus 4.7 and Opus 4.6 are $5/$25 (input/output pricing).\n\n### Opus Models\nOpus pricing is $5 per million input tokens, $25 per million output tokens, with up to 90% savings with prompt caching and 50% with batch processing. The new flagship Claude Opus 4.7 (released April 16, 2026) is $5.00 input / $25.00 output per 1M — same price as Opus 4.6.\n\n### Sonnet Model\nSonnet 4.6 remains $3.00 / $15.00 per million tokens.\n\n## Key Pricing Features\n- Claude Mythos Preview, Opus 4.7, Opus 4.6, and Sonnet 4.6 include the full 1M token context window at standard pricing\n- Output tokens cost 5x input across all models\n- The Anthropic Message Batches API processes requests asynchronously and returns results within 24 hours, at exactly 50% off standard token prices\n- Prompt caching cache hits cost just 0.1x base input, which is a 90% discount\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"be4be9fe-7cf6-4895-a169-05e0fa8f8b12","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:36:55.353Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7a05fe75-b892-48b5-90ce-30a1263f45f2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
